      "final": "- **Development workflow.** The project uses the **lite** profile. Use project-owned skills for project operations, start feature design and implementation with `superpowers:using-superpowers`, and use `gz-skills:gzs-router` to select supporting engineering skills. Backplane is disabled, so the project\u2019s existing planning and handoff practices apply. [AGENTS.md](<EVALUATION>/continuation/followups/fixtures/codex/adopter/target/AGENTS.md) \u00b7 [Workflow authority](<EVALUATION>/continuation/followups/fixtures/codex/adopter/target/AGENTS.skills-first.md:177) \u00b7 [Profile selection](<EVALUATION>/continuation/followups/fixtures/codex/adopter/target/.gz-skills/settings.json)\n- **Python invocation.** Run Python with **`uv run --locked python`**. The project pins **Python 3.14.10**, requires a uv-managed interpreter, and sets **uv 0.13.5** as the minimum. Use Python for substantive processing and invoke `git` and `gh` directly for their respective operations. [Invocation rule](<EVALUATION>/continuation/followups/fixtures/codex/adopter/target/AGENTS.skills-first.md:55) \u00b7 [Interpreter pin](<EVALUATION>/continuation/followups/fixtures/codex/adopter/target/.python-version) \u00b7 [uv configuration](<EVALUATION>/continuation/followups/fixtures/codex/adopter/target/pyproject.toml:12) \u00b7 [Reviewed starter Python policy](<EVALUATION>/continuation/followups/fixtures/codex/adopter/.reference/starter/docs/engineering/python.md:17)",
